DESCRIPTION >
    Super-admin preview: KPI summary (revenue, conversions, sessions, leads),
    trailing 30d. Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1
    port of api/routes/admin.js:303-312 (queryName 'admin_preview_kpis') — this
    was flagged in the prior batch's census as unassigned to any bucket;
    closing it here as a plain distinct_id read (identity rule #19a:
    count(DISTINCT distinct_id) AS leads, canonical stitching key, no
    argMin/argMax). Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6):
    properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type,
    properties.conversion_value -> conversion_value (typed Float64 DEFAULT 0,
    NOT Nullable).
    REAL TRANSLATION ISSUE (same class caught in batch 4): the live query
    wraps in toFloatOrZero(toString(...)) -- toFloatOrZero is PostHog HogQL
    sugar, not a native ClickHouse function; fails on Tinybird with "Unknown
    function toFloatOrZero." Translated to toFloat64OrZero, keeping the
    toString(...) wrap (redundant but harmless) since only the function name
    is invalid. No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE admin_preview_kpis_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        sumIf(toFloat64OrZero(toString(conversion_value)), event_type = '$conversion') AS revenue,
        countIf(event_type = '$conversion') AS conversions,
        countIf(event_type = '$pageview') AS sessions,
        count(DISTINCT distinct_id) AS leads
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 30 DAY

TYPE endpoint
